            <ArticleTitle>Osteomalacia presenting as pain syndromes of uncertain etiology.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>197, 199, 201</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Vitamin D deficiency can result in symptomatic osteomalacia which may cause bone pain and muscle weakness. Two patients with symptomatic osteomalacia after gastric bypass surgery are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
